---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import yogaimage from "../images/yoga.svg";
import thinkimage from "../images/think.svg";
import teamimage from "../images/team.svg";
import ContactForm from "../components/ContactFormNetlify.astro";
const pageTitle = "Jo Dobozi";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <div class="container">
    <article>
      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          Hi, I’m Jo, a Business Intelligence professional and a daughter,
          sister, partner and friend.
        </p>
        <p>
          After growing up in Hungary, I pursued my education in Germany and
          travelled the world to get to know my place in it. Once in Australia,
          I fell in love with it and my vision was clear: I ought to stay.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <div class="grid" id="trust">
        <div>
          <Image src={thinkimage} alt="Trust" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Trust, Think, Thrive</h2>
          <p>
            My best decisions in life have been guided by the sentiment of these
            three words. When I aim to achieve something, I trust in a positive
            outcome, think my plan through to succeed, and lastly, I thrive on
            what I have gained: be it what I aimed for, or what I learned from
            trying.
          </p>
          <p>
            Through this, I’ve built resilience. I’ve become adaptable and
            resourceful – both of which are invaluable assets in my personal and
            professional life alike.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <div class="grid" id="yoga">
        <div class="fp-2">
          <h2>If we’d meet in person…</h2>
          <p>
            …You’d find that I’m an attentive listener. I seek to receive what
            is shared without prejudice.
          </p>
          <p>
            You may discover my calm demeanour, even if tough questions are
            asked. I think my decisions through.
          </p>
          <p>
            You may also learn that I practice yoga and oyster mushroom
            cultivation. Being somewhat of a psychology nerd, I’m thrilled by
            each opportunity I get to understand why we humans do what we do.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="fp-1">
          <Image src={yogaimage} alt="Calmness" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <div class="grid" id="team">
        <div>
          <Image src={teamimage} alt="Team" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>If we worked together…</h2>

          <p>
            … I’d propose for our team to build on its members’ strengths and
            passions. A sense of meaning is what I seek in a role.
          </p>
          <p>
            You’d discover that I’m a dedicated professional, with my values
            being discipline, responsibility and quality.
          </p>
          <p>
            While I appreciate structure, I lean on resilience and creativity
            when there is none. This is why I enjoy working with data: finding
            insights in “chaos” is fun!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <h2 id="contact">Get in touch…</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center">
      I would love to hear from you. Just complete the form below and I shall
      get back to you as soon as I can.
    </p>
    <article>
      <ContactForm />
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .intro {
    // font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  #contact {
    text-align: center;
  }
  html {
    scroll-padding-top: 3rem;
  }
  @media only screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .fp-1 {
      order: 1;
    }
    .fp-2 {
      order: 2;
    }
  }
</style>
